    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_3aab2d07",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a group of men in what appears to be a celebratory or communal embrace, possibly in a Middle Eastern or Islamic context, given the attire and setting. The overlaid text is a vulgar, misogynistic, and Islamophobic joke that falsely claims a woman’s genital area smells like a goat, implying both sexual degradation and a crude association with animal odor. This text is intentionally offensive and targets Muslim women by combining hypersexualization (\"pussy smells like the neighbors goat\") with a degrading stereotype about hygiene and religious practice (\"from the mosque\"). The meme uses the juxtaposition of the image of men in a positive, communal embrace with the grotesque, degrading text to create a shocking, offensive, and hateful message. The intent is to provoke disgust and ridicule, targeting Muslim women through misogynistic and Islamophobic tropes, and is therefore classified as hateful content.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_d1b4d029"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
