      "description": "The meme is designed to target individuals who may hold or be exposed to Islamophobic, misogynistic, and culturally insensitive stereotypes, particularly those who might find humor in degrading portrayals of Muslim women. The intended audience likely includes people who are familiar with or sympathetic to anti-Muslim tropes, misogynistic humor, or who enjoy shock-value content that relies on offensive stereotypes. The meme’s visual context (men in a communal embrace in a Middle Eastern/South Asian setting) and textual content (mockery of religious practice, hygiene, and hypersexualization) are crafted to provoke disgust or ridicule among those who either endorse or are indifferent to such stereotypes, thereby reinforcing or spreading hateful content.",
